      // RESTORED 15/11/2026 under the golden rule (RULE-dead-sources-keep-content-20261115): the dead citation is back in this entry's list, its label marked "link dead as of" the date above; the removal below is history.
      // client": the article was deleted on 5 July 2026 (and before, in 2024 and 2006; deletion log, PRIME's browser,
      // 2026-10-18). The sources above replace it. Wool's own CV contradicted two of its details, corrected in the
      // body: he left Bell Labs in March 2000 as a member of technical staff (not a postdoctoral researcher developing the
