    // CPACKET NETWORKS - added 2026-11-16 (Industry wave I4). FOUNDING YEAR NOT
    // SOURCED: the company says only "for nearly two decades"; no page read
    // states a year, so `founded` is left out (REPORT.md). The 2024 equity
