    // RISCURE - added 2026-11-17 (Industry wave J2).
    // FOUNDED 2001: Riscure B.V.'s own pitch at ITEA's Dutch roadshow (25 May 2023)
    // gives "Creation date: 2001"; a single company-supplied source, flagged in REPORT.
